# 010 — the admin panel no longer ships all 29 locales to every user.
#
# packages/admin/src/i18n/translations/index.ts statically imported 29 JSON
# files and handed them to i18next as `resources`. tsup could not split what is
# reachable from one object literal, so the whole catalogue landed in a single
# 7.84 MB chunk (5.8 MB of it JSON) that every user downloaded to read one
# language.
#
# English stays eager — it is `fallbackLng`, so i18next must resolve it
# synchronously before first render. The other 28 become dynamic import()s
# behind a zero-dependency i18next backend module, which lets the bundler emit
# one chunk per locale and fetch only the active one. Largest chunk drops from
# 7.84 MB to 540 KB.
#
# `partialBundledLanguages: true` is required: without it i18next sees partial
# resources for a language and never calls the backend.
#
# Override precedence is preserved. The consumer's `virtual:mercur/i18n` entry
# is merged over each locale as it lands, which is what the eager deepMerge did.
#
# No new dependency: the backend is a plain BackendModule, not
# i18next-resources-to-backend.

